{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NTusGSM4yP1794812427.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍美孚萬事達第三分行分區營業經理馮健平表示，中原最新促成一宗華景山莊成交，單位為13座高層B室，實用面積1172平方呎，採三房套房間隔，另設儲物房，享開揚山景，最新以1300萬元易手，折合實用呎價11092元。<br/>中原地產馮健平指，上址原業主於2015年7月以1275萬元購入上址，持貨11年多，是次轉手賬面可獲利25萬元離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.779063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:32:52.715169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:13.495952+00:00","content_hash":"b50947e84be7668f29c352b552ab8782a277b694b1f326a83ca8a3c12ac8cc54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.779063+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}